The baseline QSDK package already carried a3e6509 and eae126f as two partial
patches.  This bundle replaces those files and replays the complete dependency
ordered source result.  The only adaptation is the %zu conversion in the older
baseline uci_get_errorstr implementation, because cca6f105 is intentionally not
backported.  No public declaration, enum or struct layout is added.

